    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Spring Festival in Shanghai is really quiet",
      "",
      "Spring Festival is a lively holiday. But in Shanghai, the Spring Festival is much quieter than in other places.",
      "Why is it like this?",
      "",
      "First of all, unlike many places, setting off firecrackers is banned in Shanghai.",
      "This is mainly for safety and reducing air pollution.",
      "",
      "Secondly, during the Spring Festival, a lot of people in Shanghai are leaving Shanghai, ..",
      ".. returning to their home regions to celebrate the Chinese New Year.",
      "Consequently, there are fewer cars on the road and also fewer people on the subway.",
      "The whole city quiets down.",
      "",
      "Sounds good, right?",
      "However, you’ll also immediately discover, that none of the shops that you’re familiar with are open for business.",
      "And all of the restaurants you often go to are also closed.",
      "As a result, you can only stay at home.",
      "Shanghai during Spring Festival becomes even quieter.",
      ""
